1) ESLint 9 Setup Guide
- File: user-docs/eslint-9-setup-guide.md (exists and begins with `Created autonomously by voder.ai`).
- Content includes:
 - Quick Setup (installing ESLint 9, @eslint/js, eslint-plugin-traceability, @typescript-eslint packages).
 - Configuration File Format (flat-config array, no `extends`, ESM vs CJS, etc.).
 - Common Configuration Patterns: JavaScript-only, TypeScript-only, and mixed JS/TS projects, each using:
 ```js
 import js from "@eslint/js";
 import traceability from "eslint-plugin-traceability";

 export default [
 js.configs.recommended,
 {
 plugins: {
 traceability,
 },
 },
 ...traceability.configs.recommended, // or .strict
 ...
 ];
 ```
 - Monorepo / workspace patterns and ignores.
 - TypeScript Integration: `@typescript-eslint/parser`, `parserOptions.project`, `tsconfigRootDir`, etc.
 - Common Issues and Solutions, and Troubleshooting ESLint Configuration sections, explaining typical flat-config errors and how to resolve them.

2) README.md integration references
