 ```
- README also shows a minimal flat-config example using `traceability.configs.recommended`.

This documentation satisfies:
- Quality Standards: follows ESLint v9 flat-config conventions and explains them clearly.
- Integration: shows how to integrate in JS-only, TS-only, mixed, and monorepo setups.
